# Student Management System

A full-stack **Student Management System** built with **React**, **FastAPI**, **PostgreSQL**, and **Axios**.

The application allows users to create, view, update, partially update, and delete student records through a simple web interface.

## Features

* Add new student records
* View all students
* View a single student by ID
* Update student records
* Partially update student records
* Delete student records
* React-based frontend
* FastAPI REST API backend
* PostgreSQL database integration
* Axios for API communication
* CORS enabled for frontend-backend communication
* Environment variables using `.env`

