    "message": "student Record Created Successfully"
}
```

---

## Update a Student

The `PUT` endpoint replaces the student record.

### Request

```http
PUT /students/3
```

### Request Body

```json
{
    "id": 3,
    "name": "Alex Brown",
    "course": "Computer Science"
}
```

### Example Response

```json
{
    "message": "student Record Updated Successfully"
}
```

---

## Partially Update a Student

The `PATCH` endpoint can update one or more fields.

### Request

```http
PATCH /students/3
```

### Example Request Body

```json
