    "course": "Data Science"
}
```

### Example Response

```json
{
    "message": "Partial Record Updated Successfully"
}
```

---

## Delete a Student

### Request

```http
DELETE /students/3
```

### Example Response

```json
{
    "message": "student Record Deleted Successfully"
}
```

