# CORS Configuration

The backend enables CORS so that the React frontend can communicate with FastAPI:

```python
app.add_middleware(
    CORSMiddleware,
    allow_origins=["*"],
    allow_credentials=True,
    allow_methods=["*"],
    allow_headers=["*"],
)
```

For a production application, replace:

```python
allow_origins=["*"]
```

with the actual frontend URL:

```python
allow_origins=["http://localhost:5173"]
```

